      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test structure. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing the ~15 unused data-provider methods (noise unrelated to this single test)\n2. Stripping unused imports\n3. Extracting the repeated loop body into a named helper method\n4. Adding brief comments clarifying CE vs BCE year-of-era logicThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes all 15 unused data-provider methods and unneeded imports, and extracts the repeated loop body into a named helper `assertEraFieldsAndRoundTrip` with a comment explaining the non-obvious BCE year-of-era arithmetic and the chronology's unusual `prolepticYear` behavior."
    }
